# Scenario name
msgid "Shoreline"
msgstr "Shoreline"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Waves of increasingly difficult enemies. Warp capable ship is strongly "
"suggested. At least one required mission and several optional missions. "
"Missions selected at random unless game master intervenes\n"
"\n"
"Maximum of 8 player ships supported by scenario. More player ships may "
"experience strange results\n"
"\n"
"Version 2"
msgstr "Waves of increasingly difficult enemies. Warp capable ship is strongly suggested. At least one required mission and several optional missions. Missions selected at random unless game master intervenes\n\nMaximum of 8 player ships supported by scenario. More player ships may experience strange results\n\nVersion 2"

